// Self-contained: no globals, no randomness, no shared state.
//
// Genome encoding (found by offline hill-climbing over thousands of simulated games, then validated on unseen seeds):
//   ops   [0, slot, typeIndex] build | [1, slot] upgrade | [2, slot] sell (types: bolt 0, cannon 1, frost 2, lance 3, flak 4);
//         executed strictly in order, each as soon as the gold is there; impossible ops are skipped.
//   tmS   per-slot target mode: 0 smallest remaining distance (the default), 3 densest splash zone, 7 damage-weighted
//         splash zone, 1 highest hp, 2 highest armour, 4 unslowed first, 5 lowest hp, 6 most useful damage.
